  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đi qua hai điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tSuy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta lại có gốc tọa độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> thuộc miền nghiệm của bất phương trình và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó miền nghiệm đã cho là miền nghiệm của bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đi qua hai điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd c